    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12139" root="دجل" body-key="d">
    
      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دجّل</span></b> , (IDrd, Msb, K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَدْجِيلٌ</span>, (K,)
<i>He covered</i> (IDrd, Msb, K,) anything. (IDrd,
Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also 1, in two places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <i>He gilded</i>
[a thing]; (K;) <i>he washed over</i> anything <i>with
gold.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <i>It</i> (a river overflowing) <i>covered</i>
the land <i>with water.</i> (Mgh.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دجّل أَرْضَهُ</span>, inf.
n. as above, <i>He put his land into a right,</i> or
<i>proper, state, prepared it,</i> or <i>improved it, with</i>
[<i>dung such as is called</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَجَال</span>, i. e.] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِرْجِين</span>
(TA.)

